  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>Аргонавты</h1>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/H1OfN7.png\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/modrinth-734077874708938864\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/bfhVRm.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/ijAZ9w.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cadmus\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/4nYDHe.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heracles\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/Svj6w9.png\" width=\"147\" height=\"56\"> </a><hr>\n<h2>📖 О моде 📖</h2>\n<p>Названный в честь великих героев, плывших с Ясоном на корабле Арго, Argonauts — это утилитарный мод, который позволяет вам работать вместе как команда с другими игроками на ваших мультиплеерных серверах с помощью различных гильдий и партий.</p>\n<p>Он позволяет общаться с ними через чат гильдии или партии, управлять правами доступа ваших товарищей по команде и самих участников с помощью удобного графического интерфейса, а также участвовать в совместных мероприятиях с членами вашей команды, таких как <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heracles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Выполнение заданий</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cadmus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Заявление прав на землю</a>.</p>\n<img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/FJianb.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"> <img src=\"https://files.teamresourceful.com/r/l2xD5h.png\" width=\"3024\" height=\"1964\">&nbsp; <br><hr><br>\n<h2>Посмотрите остальные проекты проекта Odyssey!</h2>\n<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/argonauts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/05PfzF.svg\" alt=\"Argonauts\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heracles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/RzlEoy.svg\" alt=\"Heracles\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/terrarium-earth/Hermes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/gD9eSY.svg\" alt=\"Hermes\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cadmus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/YqZ7Hf.svg\" alt=\"Cadmus\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/DP8PUz.svg\" alt=\"Prometheus\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a> <br><br><hr><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fterrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/ZPPPAG.svg\" width=\"562\" height=\"103\"> </a><hr><br>\n<h2>Социальные сети</h2>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"> </a><hr><br>\n<h2>Посмотрите наши другие проекты</h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/9DjUsr.svg\" alt=\"Handcrafted\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/lRunun.svg\" alt=\"Chipped\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/snZW6z.svg\" alt=\"Ad Astra\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tempad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/HPp8Fo.svg\" alt=\"Tempad\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colorful-